Title: Generate Prompt & Instruction Set Frontend UI (React + TypeScript + Tailwind) 
seperate runnable project. 

Description:
Build a modern, hosted frontend-only application for a Construction Payroll System. 
Use React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS to create responsive, accessible UI components 
that interact with the provided RESTful API endpoints. Backend services are assumed to 
be deployed and accessible via /api/v1... paths. 

Task:
1. UI Needs to be responsive design and available for mobile, tablet and web browsers.

2. Generate a React/Typescript dashboard UI for building out a prompt, 
instruction sets for business, product, software engineering and development. Would like to save 
and categorizing the instructions, plus show relations between connected instructions to execute against. 
Would like to leverage Tailwind CSS, https://reactflow.dev/ for visualization and a slide out navigation 
for the groups of instructions/prompts to choose from and drop in. 


API Categories to Integrate:

Management
	•	List, create, edit, delete instructions & prompts
	•	Endpoints:
	•	GET /api/instructions
	•	GET /api/instructions/{id}
	•	POST /api/instructions or prompts
	•	PUT /api/instructions/{id}
	•	DELETE /api/instructions/{id}

System Health
	•	Show system health status in footer or dashboard
	•	Endpoint: GET /health

UI Functional Requirements
	•	React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
	•	Use React Router for page navigation
	•	Use Axios or Fetch for API calls
	•	Implement basic loading states and error handling
	•	Form validation using React Hook Form or similar
	•	Pages:
		•	Home Dashboard
		•	Instruction Entries List
		•	Settings

Bonus Features (Optional)
	•	Dark Mode toggle
	•	React Query/SWR for API data management
	•	Mobile-responsive grid/table layouts
